2_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp5.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp6.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp7.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp8.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp6_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp7_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01030000/RJ01029352_img_smp8_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "My Giant Friend [Hentai Room]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "マクロフィリア好きの方に送るゲームです!", "body": [{"intro": "村で何度も軽蔑された花屋のルニは、家庭菜園を一生懸命世話してくれる巨人の女性を探すことにした。<br />\r\nルニの目的は至ってシンプル。巨人を助ける代わりに、誰もが自分を尊敬するようになる方法を学ぶことだった。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nそんな中、どんな人間でも巨人に変えることができる秘密のビタミンホエイを有する勇敢な退役戦士、レディー・ブレログに出会う。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nしかし変身プロセスはル二が夢にも思わなかった経験となる。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nこのゲームにはコメディとマクロフィリアコンテンツが含まれています。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-ルニが巨人化するまでの過程<br />\r\n-4つのエンディング(バッド2、グッド1。すべてをクリアすると、2回目に別のバッドエンディングになった時に使用出来るシークレットが1つアンロックされます。)<br />\r\n-コメディ(全てが大げさなストーリー。キャラクターも巨人です!)<br />\r\n-ゲームギャラリー<br />\r\n-ゲームプレイ時間:約1～2時間<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter being disrespected several times in her village, Runi, a young florist, decided to find a giant woman who was desperate to repair her vegetable garden.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuni's goal was fairly simple: help the giant in exchange for learning how to make everyone respect her. And that started to happen after she met Lady Blerog, a fierce retired warrior who had a secret vitamin whey capable of turning any human into a giant.<br />\r\nWhat Runi wasn't expecting was such a huge transformation process would provide giant experiences that she had never dreamed about.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game contains comedy and macrophilia stuff.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Follow Runi's process of turning into a giant<br />\r\n-4 Endings (2 Bad ones, 1 Good. Complete those 3 and unlock 1 Secret that will be available if you get another Bad for the second time)<br />\r\n-Comedy (everything is exaggerated… the girls are giants, right?!)<br />\r\n-Game Gallery<br />\r\n-Around 1~2 hours of gameplay"}]}], "description": "マクロフィリア好きの方に送るゲームです!", "short_introduction": "マクロフィリア好きの方に送るゲームです!", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01029352.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794953943}